"The gods once lived on Davrar, learned its structure, and rebelled against the Questors."
"Davrar itself granted the gods their might, and they turned it against the Questors."
"The gods prophesied their own fate and tried in anger to break Davrar."
"The gods were mortals in truth, since they could die."
"All worship on Davrar is a mechanic in the Questors' game."
"The Endings add new powers and were used to remove overbearing gods."
"The Questor Brox struck down the god Quenfi on the broken continent."
"Sereth was the nightmare among the gods for the Questors to slay."
"Later, a wolfman cleric claims part of Deiman's remnant in the Crater and gains a godhead."
